          <h2>Quality checks and measurement reporting</h2>
          <p>
            For business orders, consistency matters. We can agree a clear spec (material, finish, critical dimensions),
            then run a repeatable workflow for reorders and revisions.
          </p>
          <p>
            Visual QC is standard. For tighter requirements, we can measure agreed critical features using precision callipers.
            If your project needs documentation, we can provide a simple measurement pack by agreement:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Photos showing how key dimensions are measured</li>
            <li>Annotated measurement points (e.g., A–B, C–D)</li>
            <li>A table (Excel/CSV) with measured values</li>
            <li>Optional comparison vs CAD with deviation (%) where relevant</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="muted">
            Scope is agreed upfront (which features, how many samples per batch, and what “acceptable” looks like).
          </p>
